- Number of e-books you read last two years is in [1-5, nan]
- Number of printed books you read last two years is in [1-5, nan]
- Favorite books for reading to spend leisure time is in [Fiction, Politics]
- Frequency of reading books is not "On everyday basis"
- What is the change that you feel after reading books is not "Increase Academic Performance"
- How to manage books for reading is in [Borrow, Others]
- Format that you used for reading books is not "Both"

---

10 different conditions for class "1" (Reads academic books most of the time):

- Department is in [CSE, SWE, Pharmacy, EEE, Civil, Textile, CIS, MCT]
- Reason for reading books is "Academic Purpose"
- Amount of time spent reading books per day >= 2
- Number of e-books you read last two years is in [11-15, 16-20, More than 20]
- Number of printed books you read last two years is in [11-15, 16-20, More than 20]
- Favorite books for reading to spend leisure time is in [Non-Fiction, Biography]
- Frequency of reading books is "On everyday basis"
